        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Additionally, the parties have agreed to increase the pay rate for the General Storekeeper classification as outlined in Attachment I. The parties have also agreed to the revisions shown on the General Storekeeper, Storekeeper and Utility employee classifications (Attachments II-IV).",
